      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "police_brutality_context",
      "label": "Context of Police Brutality Against Black Citizens",
      "description": "The meme references real-world events and systemic issues of police violence and racial profiling against Black people in the United States, particularly in the context of fatal shootings of unarmed Black individuals. This background knowledge is necessary to understand the meme's hateful intent and its connection to historical and contemporary social justice movements.",
